nage by chat alone**.\n\n**(3/4)** Is the pain **severe or rapidly worsening**, and are you having **shortness of breath, marked weakness/fainting, confusion, or trouble keeping fluids down**?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_03d448d586bed2670169c3cb975ba48191b88b0d7bc2c8a4e6\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":416,"output":200,"cacheRead":32384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":33000,"cost":{"input":0.0010400000000000001,"output":0.003,"cacheRead":0.008095999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.012136}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774439312544}}
